{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026IGWXqQskte1792638756.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>港股走勢反覆向好，收復兩萬三關口。</p><p></p><p>恒指高開93點後一度掉頭跌過130點，不過低位有買盤，指數很快重上23,000點水平。</p><p></p><p>科網股個別發展，阿里巴巴及騰訊偏軟，但小米升半成，為表現最好藍籌。汽車股造好，比亞迪及理想汽車升百分之4。連日捱沽的寧德時代也反彈百分之4。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T06:23:58.020041+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":132,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T05:19:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T21:38:08.343373+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T06:18:10.145713+00:00","content_hash":"9a8f8206d7435de1323aaca58b3424a6e889d7420000d9bb16674732fd3a6cda","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T06:23:58.020041+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}